# S-047 obs-ffmpeg sources/encoders: wrappers #include the real obs-ffmpeg-source.c and
# obs-ffmpeg-audio-encoders.c; obs-ffmpeg-video-encoders.c is linked; libobs data/properties are real;
# libavcodec and the OBS host are recording fakes, libavutil is the real system library.
# -I paths are relative to test/conformance (run.sh must be started there).
